      objectReference: {fileID: 1696977786}
    - target: {fileID: 3542944276342434931, guid: b1827a3555d0aa948b34e5bf7e99ff2f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: writtenOnSign
      value: Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Fusce condimentum,
        nisi quis vehicula vehicula, eros ligula vestibulum elit, eu egestas neque
        lacus nec lacus. Integer vulputate mattis consectetur. Nam gravida fermentum
        erat, in condimentum neque commodo eu. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur
        adipiscing elit.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3542944276342434931, guid: b1827a3555d0aa948b34e5bf7e99ff2f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: writtenOnSign.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3542944276342434931, guid: b1827a3555d0aa948b34e5bf7e99ff2f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: writtenOnSign.Array.data[0]
      value: This room is so dark! Pick up a light crystal to show the way, but look
        out for pitfalls! Don't worry, the crystal will respawn if it falls. You
        can also throw it across gaps.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3542944276342434931, guid: b1827a3555d0aa948b34e5bf7e99ff2f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: writtenOnSign.Array.data[1]
      value: Interact with a crate to get a rope! Your next arrow can be used to
        pull yourself towards columns without worrying of falling down.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3542944276342434931, guid: b1827a3555d0aa948b34e5bf7e99ff2f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: writtenOnSign.Array.data[2]
      value: Shoot at purple crystal to activate doors! Each door is linked to a
        specific crystal, and don't worry, once they're open they will never close
        again
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3542944276342434942, guid: b1827a3555d0aa948b34e5bf7e99ff2f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: Signpost
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
